# Geometry Dash 🎮 — Python Game

**Version:** 0.1.0  
**Last Updated:** 2026-03-26  
**Platform:** macOS (Apple Silicon M1 / M2 / M3)  
**Language:** Python 3.10+  
**Dependencies:** managed with [uv](https://github.com/astral-sh/uv) + `pyproject.toml`

**GITHUB:** [matusfil-ux](https://github.com/matusfil-ux/geometrydash)

> 🎮 **Jump over red spikes, beat your high score, then open the code and make it your own!**  
> This is a real Python package — the same structure used by professional programmers.

